<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\たたら場.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "$797979" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>A space hung with pure white fog.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A strong, damp wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An unpleasant air, thick with the smell of nature, as if it were rejecting humans.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Snow?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wind and cherry blossoms―there seems to be no doubt that this place is outdoors.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then where is this place?<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Number 204</STYLE>, move out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. I've gone back to prison again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I thought I could live with <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haha. It was frightening, but I got to dream a good dream.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\歩く響く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Two guards take hold of both my arms and start walking somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no need to pull so hard. I'll walk and do as I'm told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But is this all right? Not putting handcuffs on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I shook my arms free right now, I'd run off, wouldn't I?<PG>
Even so, this fog is deep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't even see the faces of the guards who must be on either side of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can tell is that the guards are wearing white.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were the guards' uniforms... 
{PAUSE ""}
like this?<PG>
Oh, right. I'm being transferred to the prison in Motoki City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The guards' uniforms in Motoki City must be white.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we'll be together forever, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE> voice...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one holding my right arm is <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Calling you Mom is embarrassing, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I feel the same as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From my left arm comes <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The guards transferring me... are my daughters?<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Here we are, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"This is where we belong."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\中央公園\御神木足跡なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In front of me, floating hazily in the fog, a giant cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't see the faces of the two at my sides, yet this tree alone, hazy as it is, I can see oddly clearly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-814\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-814\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is the prison...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahaha, no. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This isn't a prison. It's where the Goddess is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The Goddess...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\美冬白装束2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "11" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In front of the giant cherry tree stands a woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dressed in white as well―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, it's <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's been a while, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Now all four of us are here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花白装束バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "300" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, now we can finally grant the Goddess's wish!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ白装束32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "300" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We did it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Goddess?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All four of us here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What are they talking about?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The three of them talk happily, but what they're talking about, I―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we're going to stay here together forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"At the Goddess's side, we can be together for eternity."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Here, with the daughters we love, together forever―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "600" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n0\r\n8000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something like thick ropes <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="は">crawls</STYLE> out from under my feet, and then―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They wind around my neck, my wrists, my ankles.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What... is this!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, this is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The Goddess's name is..."</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,111,222,人物3,人物2,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
